@page "/live-options-score"
@attribute [Authorize]
@rendermode InteractiveServer
@using NiftySignal.Dashboard.Components.Dashboard

@* Dashboard reorg (2026-09-21, docs/LIVE_PARITY_PLAN.md): this page's own content (Current Bar
   Score / Max Pain / Open Position / Today's Trades) was extracted into LiveOptionsScorePanel so
   it could ALSO be embedded at the top of Home.razor, now the primary place this data is seen.
   This standalone page is kept for a focused, full-detail view (and for anyone with it
   bookmarked) -- it's now a thin wrapper around the shared component, not a separate
   implementation. *@

<PageTitle>Live Options Score</PageTitle>

<div class="dashboard-shell">
    <div style="padding: 4px 0 12px;">
        <a href="/" class="login-link">&larr; Back to dashboard</a>
    </div>

    <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr); gap:16px;">
        <LiveOptionsScorePanel ShowFullPageLink="false" />
    </div>
</div>
